      "side": 1,
      "message": "nit: this struct exposes raw info from D3D12, can we leave the decision to support bindless based on D3D12 tiers and other info to PhysicalDeviceD3D12?",
      "revId": "306dff40715bbdb0f8217fbb89c61572633acc30",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
